  "body": " Idea of the proof of the Intermediate Value Theorem   For a target value , apply bisection to   If and have opposite signs, repeatedly keep the half interval where the sign change remains. The nested intervals shrink to a point . Continuity prevents from being positive or negative, so   Therefore    "
