  "title": "an equation with no exact formula needed.",
  "body": " an equation with no exact formula needed   The equation   has a solution in .  Let   This function is continuous on . Also,   At ,   because . Therefore, by the Intermediate Value Theorem, there is some such that   Thus   The theorem does not solve the equation exactly. It tells us a solution must exist. Numerical methods can then approximate it.   "
