  "title": "What is the difference between a definite integral and an indefinite integral?",
  "body": " What is the difference between a definite integral and an indefinite integral?   One object is and the other is . In your own words, why is the first a number and the second a family of functions, even though the same integral sign appears in both?    Limits of integration turn accumulation into a completed amount. Removing the limits asks for all functions whose derivative is the integrand.   "
