  "title": "Example.",
  "body": " Example   A -foot chain weighs pounds per foot. How much work is required to pull the entire hanging chain up to the roof?  Here   So   Compute:   foot-pounds.  The unit is foot-pound because the force is measured in pounds and the distance in feet.   "
