  "title": "a definite integral can simplify by symmetry.",
  "body": " a definite integral can simplify by symmetry   Evaluate   The integrand   is odd, because   The interval is symmetric about . Therefore the positive and negative parts cancel:   We could also use substitution, but symmetry is faster and more revealing.   For definite integrals, use definite information  Before finding an antiderivative, check for   A definite integral may have a simple value even when the indefinite integral is hard.    "
