  "title": "How does plane motion package calculus into pairs?",
  "body": " How does plane motion package calculus into pairs?   Position has velocity components and . In your own words, why is that pair already a bridge to vectors, and what does its length measure?    Each coordinate is an ordinary function of time. The pair points in the direction of motion; its length is the speed.   "
