  "body": " halfway to a target   Let   Each step moves halfway from the current value to .  The first few terms are   The terms appear to approach .  First show that they stay below . If , then   Since , induction gives   for every .  Now show that the sequence increases. Compute   Since , this difference is positive. Therefore   The sequence is increasing and bounded above by . By the Monotone Convergence Theorem, it converges.  Let its limit be . Passing to the limit in the recursion gives   Thus   so   The sequence converges to .   The recursion moves halfway to at each step.       "
